          "The og:title, og:description, og:image, and og:url tags tell Facebook, Slack, and messengers what to show in a card. twitter:card (summary_large_image) complements this for X. The image must be an absolute URL, large enough (around 1200×630), and not behind a login. The description should be unique per page, not the same one site-wide. If OG is missing, a crawler may pick a random paragraph or nothing. After changing the image, change the URL (a version in the path): preview caches are sticky. Do not put personal data in a preview.",
          ["Абсолютний og:image достатнього розміру, відкритий без логіну", "Унікальні title і description на кожну сторінку", "Новий URL картинки, бо кеш прев'ю живучий"],
