          "A script type=application/ld+json in the head or at the end of the body describes Article, FAQPage, or BreadcrumbList in the schema.org vocabulary. Search engines may show a rich snippet if the data is honest and matches the visible content: a fake 5-star rating is a violation. JSON-LD is cleaner than microdata in attributes because it does not clutter markup. Validate with the Rich Results Test. Do not emit conflicting types on one page. Dynamic data (a price) must update with the page, not go stale in a cached script.",
